    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1886" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθά̆λασσ-ος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθά̆λασσ-ττος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without sea, far from it, inland</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				462.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθαλάσσωτος, βασιλεύς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Secund.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not mixed with sea-water</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Damocr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zopyr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				14.61.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.95
			</span></i>.</div>
